title: The redraw delta's stripped form is one rule in three places.
pid: 0e406087-ff1f-49d0-93f8-234bb62ebe6c
body: |2-
  The server and both clients compare texts without the fold and focus atoms, and all
  three test against 'tests/shared/fold-and-focus-atom-strip-cases.txt'. Change it in all
  three or none. No delta means the client redraws the whole buffer.
